NOTE ON THIS DIRECTORY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The notebooks in c3/m9 are derivative works of `M_Causal_MOOC.ipynb` from

    https://github.com/tbeucler/2026_ECMWF_MOOC

which is distributed under the MIT License reproduced above. The MIT notice
is retained here as required. Changes made for this course are listed in
c3/m9/NOTICE.md.

The rest of this repository is licensed under Apache-2.0 (see ../../LICENSE).

The notebooks additionally *download at runtime* (they do not redistribute)
helper modules and the preprocessed fold data from

    https://github.com/saranya8989/2025_CausalSHIPS

archived as Ganesh S., S., & Tam, F. I.-H. (2025). saranya8989/2025_CausalSHIPS:
Causal SHIPS v1.0. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17242382,
released under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

The workflow figure in assets/causal_workflow.png is Figure 1 of
Ganesh et al. (2026), Weather and Forecasting, 41(7), 1359-1375,
https://doi.org/10.1175/WAF-D-25-0208.1, reproduced with attribution.
